```python
@property
def total(self):
    subtotal = sum(item.price for item in self.items.all())
    if self.promo_code:
        discount = 0.1 * subtotal  # buggy float
    else:
        discount = 0
    return round(subtotal - discount, 2)
```

I changed it to:

```python
from decimal import Decimal

@property
def total(self):
    subtotal = sum((Decimal(str(item.price)) for item in self.items.all()), Decimal('0'))
    if self.promo_code:
        discount = Decimal('0.1') * subtotal
    else:
        discount = Decimal('0')
    return float((subtotal - discount).quantize(Decimal('0.01')))
```

